          "source_excerpt": {
            "shared": "1050. 已知二次方程的根是 $y_1$ 和 $y_2$，列方程：",
            "task": "а) $y_1=10$，$y_2=12$；"
          },
          "domain": "y is real; the prescribed roots are real. Real nonzero scalar multiples of the canonical equation are equally valid.",
